<wpt lat="44.624492" lon="-80.730579"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Bayview Escarpment Provincial Nature Reserve (south): roadside parking along the St. Free · book ahead</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.637540" lon="-80.733410"><name>P2 alternative parking</name><desc>Bayview Escarpment Provincial Nature Reserve (north): Off road parking along the St. Free · book ahead. Joins the route near km 10.6 (0 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.614607" lon="-80.708010"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Continue straight onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading south. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.618155" lon="-80.701539"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Kaboom Side Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.622243" lon="-80.701959"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Continue straight onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading north-east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.642270" lon="-80.718035"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Continue straight onto the blue-blazed Bayview Escarpment Side Trail, heading west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.637670" lon="-80.733440"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: Turn left onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading south. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.) The next 0.0 km follows an unopened road allowance (rough track, no traffic).</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.627915" lon="-80.731215"><name>J6</name><desc>J6: Continue straight onto the blue-blazed River Kwai Side Trail, heading south. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
